 a chord from near the edge is the most valuable observation of all.\nClose
 st approach 00:45:36 IST\, give or take 2 s. The star is 26° up in the EN
 E · dark sky.\nIt fades 3.3 magnitudes for up to 1.1 s on the centre line
 \, and the path is 18 km wide\, give or take 13 km.\nFinder chart\, the ma
 p and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/asteroids-2026-09#2026-09-
